   - `crates/ai/README.md` lines 193-194: change "(`reply_face_value` of what it deals through the hero's Armor)" to "(`reply_face_value` of what it deals through the hero's Armor, plus a Lifesteal attacker's heal of it unless the hit is lethal, #3858)".
   - `docs/polish/3-ai.md` lines 545-546: change "(`reply_face_value` of its `projected_hero_damage`)" to "(`reply_face_value` of its `projected_hero_damage`, plus a Lifesteal attacker's heal of it unless the hit is lethal, #3858)".
