## Done when

- [ ] `face_value` adds the Lifesteal heal for a non-lethal hit on the hero, and the self-damage under a converter; the lethal shortcut stays first.
- [ ] `trade_value` calls `lifesteal_value`, and its existing tests are unchanged and green.
- [ ] The 4 new tests and the rewritten ranking test pass; `cargo test -p jackioh-ai` is green.
